    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, slide and bounce around to never be late to a delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garry is always hungry, feed him potions, batteries, any junk you can find, and he'll defend you in any way he can</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of unique underworld locations, from old medieval villages to towering castles full of mad scientists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcadey levels full of monsters, items, traps and even secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer - team up and work together in story levels or battle it out in deathmatch arenas</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, slide and bounce around to never be late to a delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garry is always hungry, feed him potions, batteries, any junk you can find, and he'll defend you in any way he can</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of unique underworld locations, from old medieval villages to towering castles full of mad scientists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcadey levels full of monsters, items, traps and even secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer - team up and work together in story levels or battle it out in deathmatch arenas</p></li></ul>",
